          "bullets": [
            "Notion says that \"upon analysis of the dataset Fireworks AI gave us on November 8, we discovered that it included Notion AI chat transcripts used for the Insights feature, which for the vast majority of impacted workspaces were unattributable\" — meaning chats \"not labeled with who wrote them or which workspace they came from\", with transcripts that \"did not contain tool call results\". BleepingComputer reports that \"less than 1% of its users are impacted\".",
